        },
        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "Magnetica is a puzzle game for Nintendo DS in which players use the stylus to launch marbles onto a moving track. The aim is to match three or more marbles of the same colour before the line reaches the end of the path.\n\nThe game features single-player modes, including Challenge, Quest, and Puzzle, with different tracks, power-ups, hazards, and stage layouts. It also includes head-to-head multiplayer, where players can use items that obstruct, deflect or alter the movement of launched marbles.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
